Subject: [PATCH] Freeze proof and revocation bindings for the running session

Copyright (C) 2026 Artur Yakymenko
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

Apply after patches 0001 through 0010 on niri v26.04. Capture complete safety
bindings and their physical startup keymap. Classify and dispatch backend keys
through a private state that live layout, option and keymap-file reloads cannot
replace. Keep ordinary layout and binding reloads live. Revocation uses the
captured environment and a build-time executable identity. Missing startup
bindings can recover only from the build-time packaged config path.

